  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sumeet Chadha & Anr vs Municipal Corporation Of Delhi & Ors on 29 August, 2025 $~76 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(C) 13248/2025, Cm Appl. 54373/2025 & Cm Appl. 54374/2025 Sumeet Chadha & Anr. ..... Pet Through: Mr. Taksh Suri and Mr. Abhijeet Singh, Advs. versus Municipal Corporation Of Delhi & Ors. ..... Responden Through: Mr. Rajat Jariwal, Ms. Gauri P and Mr. Parimal Kashyap, Advs. R-2 Mr. Raghvendra Upadhyay, PC wi Ms. Purnima Jain and Mr. Tanma Jain, Advs. for R-5 (Through V Ms. Shilpa Ohri, Adv. with Mr. Pritish Sabharwal, Adv. Mr. Gaganmeet Singh Sachdeva, Harshpreet Singh Chadha and Mr Hridyesh Khanna, Advs. for STF",
    "facts": "1 3. The present writ petition has been filed seeking directions to immediately cease the unauthorized and illegal commercial activities being carried out by respondent no.2 from the lower ground floor (basement) and upper ground floor of the property bearing No. 9/1, East Patel Nagar, New Delhi-110008. 4. Learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submits that the respondent no. 2, i.e., M/S Blinkit Commerce Private Limited, has unlawfully commenced commercial activity of delivery/distribution hub from residential premises on the lower ground floor (basement) and upper ground floor of the property in question. 5. It is submitted that the commercial activity has been going on since April, 2025. 6. It is submitted that the business in question is being operated from the premises without the mandatory license and approvals from the Delhi Fire Service as well as the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (\"FSSAI\"). 7. It is submitted that such operation, without following the requisite statutory provisions, not only renders the activity wholly illegal, but also endangers public safety and health. The authenticity of the order can be re-verified from Delhi High Court Order Portal by scanning the QR code shown above.",
    "arguments": "",
